All 11 files under frames/, including frames/oracle/, are renders of
fixtures/en-halloween-decorating/ -- scene.json and scene-video.json name its stills, its
logo and its published MP4 by path -- so each composites the channel's photography, its
logo, or both. That media is "all rights reserved", and a render of copyrighted media is
a derivative of it, so these carry the same terms:

    Copyright (c) 2026 Mohammad Bagher Ehtemam. All rights reserved. Permission is
    granted to use these files ONLY to build, test, benchmark and study this repository.
    Any other use requires the copyright holder's written permission.

The Rust source, the scene files, README.md and FINDINGS.md are MIT with the rest of the
repository (../../../../LICENSE). The canonical list of every carved-out path in the tree
is ../../../../LICENSE-MEDIA.md.
